:: Chance for tips {"position":"1212,24.166666666666714","size":"100,100"}
There is a Librarian sitting at the front desk, amid a sea of chairs, tables, and green tinted lamps.
There are doorways leading to two sections and a main aisle curving away in the opposite direction.
The room is only one floor, as is the rest of the building.
The walls are panelled and have paintings hung on them.
There are a few people sitting in the room, doing their own thing silently.


I go up to the [[old man]].
I go up to the [[young man]].
I go up to the [[woman]].
I go up to the [[little girl]].
I go up to the [[Librarian]].


