:: DRAGON KEEPER STUCK ENDING {"position":"4053,3042","size":"100,100"}
DRAGON KEEPER ENDING

Congratulations!
You are now the proud owner of three dragon eggs.
You are unable to part from the eggs until they hatch, and the dragon babies will be a constant in your life forever.
And, as the dragons cannot leave the library, you must remain with them. Indefinitely.

...I hope you don't like being in the possession of gold (or metal in general), because once they are old enough, the dragons will take everything shiny they see and hoard it in places you'll never reach again.


