:: Fantasy Image {"position":"1328.9999999999998,340.00000000000006","size":"100,100"}
The picture is of a clutch of scaly eggs. Each egg is a different jeweled color and sits upon a bed of faded, rusting coins. It seems the very bottoms of the eggs are rusting too. The backdrop of the painting is gray.

I [[look away|Main Room]].


:: Fantasy Section {"position":"4366.333333333334,2796.166666666667","size":"100,100"}
I am in an open room with a doorway behind me and another to my left.

There are tables and chairs dotted throughout the space. Bookshelves line the walls, with chests and scrolls poking out between the books. There are vials, beakers, and a strange assortment of items all over the tables. The table closest to the door holds three chests.

I hear a voice behind all the bookshelves.

(if: $inv contains "Fantasy Book") [<do nothing>]
(else-if: $inv contains "Fantasy Book")[<do nothing>]
(else:)[I [[follow|Fantasy Start]] the strange voice.]
I walk back to the [[Main Room]].
I skirt along the wall and walk into the [[Romance Section]].


:: Fantasy Start {"position":"4363.999999999999,2939.5","size":"100,100"}
I step in the room.
The opening behind me becomes overgrown with vines and thorns.

The voice says something again.

"Hello!" I call.

"North, east, east, north, and go to the tables," the voice calls.

[["Might as well find out who that is. Maybe they can help me leave."|f open]]


:: Fantasy Tip {"position":"1852.3333333333326,422.50000000000006","size":"100,100"}
“Darling! It’s time to go,” the woman says, coming over.

“But Mommy! I have to tell-”

“What did I tell you about talking to strangers?” The woman takes her daughter’s hand and half drags her, gently, out of the chair.

“Mommy-”

“No, we are late as we are,” the woman says.

"Just five more minutes! Please!"

The woman sighs, "...Alright."

The little girl turns around to look at me, “*Blue* is such a magical color, don't you think?”


I ask her about her favorite [[section|Western Tip]].
I leave her [[alone|Chance for tips]].


