:: Front Door {"position":"1100,25","size":"100,100"}
I stand in front of a large library. It's walls are red and orange brick, covered in vines and moss. The short black marble steps lead to two dark colored pillars guarding a set of rich double hard wood doors.

The plaque next to the door says 'Enigma Reiter Library.'

A few of my friends had recommended this library to me, but only on reputation, saying there is none like it.
But, so far, I've seen more impressive libraries before.

I walk up the steps and open the [[doors|Chance for tips]].

