:: Item 1 {"position":"669.9999999999999,24.166666666666686","size":"100,100"}
The restroom has the following:
-five stalls along the far wall
-four sinks to the left of the door
-one big mirror on the left wall
-two wide light strips in the center of the ceiling
-a hand dryer between the sinks and the mirror
-a drain in the center of the floor
-a small vent high up on the wall next to the stalls
-the right wall is blank


I cover the entire mirror with [[sticky notes|i1w1]].
I rip up the [[sticky notes|i1w2]] and flush them down a toilet.
I plug the hand dryer using the [[sticky notes|i1w3]].
I create an artwork on the blank wall using the [[sticky notes|Item 2]].
I cover all the sink drains with [[sticky notes|i1w4]] and try to get them to overflow.
I walk back to the lost and found, put everything back, and close the [[door|Main Aisle 1]].


:: Item 2 {"position":"565.0000000000001,24.999999999999957","size":"100,100"}
I take the sticky notes and start carefully placing them on the blank wall. I finish, standing back for a moment to admire my masterpiece.

All is quiet.


I plug a sink with the [[head of broccoli|i2w1]].
I lay on the floor, rip off pieces of the [[head of broccoli|Item 3]] and try to hit the lights.
I bash the [[head of broccoli|i2w2]] against the mirror.
I hide the [[head of broccoli|i2w3]] behind the vent in the wall.
I drop the [[head of broccoli|i2w4]] in a toilet.
I walk back to the lost and found, put everything back, and close the [[door|Main Aisle 1]].


:: Item 3 {"position":"460.00000000000006,23.333333333333314","size":"100,100"}
I lay in the center of the floor, holding the broccoli in one hand. I take a piece and toss it in the air. It doesn't quite reach the lights, so I throw another one.

Eventually, all the broccoli is in pieces on the floor.


I wash the [[pile of clothes|i3w1]] in the sink.
I drop the [[pile of clothes|i3w2]] over the drain in the floor.
I hang the [[pile of clothes|i3w3]] over the stall doors.
I check to see if anything in the [[pile of clothes|i3w4]] fits me by holding them in front of the mirror.
I plug all the toilets with the [[pile of clothes|Item 4]].
I walk back to the lost and found, put everything back, and close the [[door|Main Aisle 1]].


:: Item 4 {"position":"353.3333333333333,24.99999999999998","size":"100,100"}
I divide the clothes into five smaller piles.
I open the first stall and stuff the clothes inside.
I open the second stall and freeze, before tossing the fabric in the general direction of the toilet and close the door.
I open the third stall and plug my nose as I drop the fabric in the bowl.
I open the fourth stall and stuff the clothes inside.
I open the fifth stall and step around the puddle to reach the toilet.

I then step back out into the open area.


I try to fit the entire [[pool cue|Item 5]] inside the vent in the wall.
I break the drain in the floor with the [[pool cue|i4w1]].
I use the [[pool cue|i4w2]] to slam all the stall doors open.
I check if the mirror is longer than the [[pool cue|i4w3]].
I whack at the lights wildly with the [[pool cue|i4w4]].
I walk back to the lost and found, put everything back, and close the [[door|Main Aisle 1]].


:: Item 5 {"position":"248.33333333333334,28.333333333333247","size":"100,100"}
It was easy to open the vent, because the screws were loose. I take the pool cue and poke the thicker end into the vent. I slide it through, but it hits a dead end when only three fourths of the stick is inside.

I try to ram it back, but it doesn't work, so I leave it there.


I throw the [[cinderblock|i5w1]] at the blank wall.
I bash the vent in the wall with the [[cinderblock|i5w2]].
I destroy hand dryer with the [[cinderblock|Kicked Out]].
I soak the [[cinderblock|i5w3]] in the sink.
I throw the [[cinderblock|i5w4]] up and try to hit one of the lights.
I walk back to the lost and found, put everything back, and close the [[door|Main Aisle 1]].


