:: Mystery Start {"position":"1025.666666666667,1702.5","size":"100,100"}
The detective greets me with my name, which find odd. I read his badge, "Detective Steve," I say.
"You finally got here. What took so long?" He asks.
Before I can answer, he starts walking to the center of the room. I follow.

"We have a murder on our hands, of a one Kate Bells. Five foot seven, blonde, and we're guessing about sixteen years old.
"There are three witnesses and we've narrowed it down to five suspects. I'm sure you can piece it together." He sighs, "I'm at a loss, really."

I look at him blankly.
"You got this partner?"
I nod slowly, "Yeah, I got this."
"Great, let me know if you have any questions," he starts to walk away, "and feel free to ask Officer Nat and Officer James anything too. Their on this case with us."


I walk to the [[Suspects]] 
I walk to the [[Witnesses]] 
I walk to the [[Crime Scene]] 

I have a *suspect list* and a *witness list* to tell me things about the people.
(set: $inv to $inv + (a: "Witness List"))
(set: $inv to $inv + (a: "Suspect List"))



