:: WESTERN COMPLETION ENDING [donotshowinventory] {"position":"2394.9999999999995,107.5","size":"100,100"}
<h2>COMPLETION ENDING: Western</h2>

This ending was achieved by successfully getting through the Western section of the Library, which gives the player a book, and then checking out the book at the Librarian.
This is the only way to get this ending, but there isn't one strict route the player must take to reach it within the section.


There are six(6) total types of endings.


:: WORK ENDING {"position":"8579.333333333332,4571.666666666667","size":"100,100"}



Because you couldn't pay the bill, the restraunt hired you to work in the kitchen. But, due to the small wage you earn, it will be a long time until you are allowed to leave debt free.


:: WRONG COLORS ENDING {"position":"5915.333333333333,3884.000000000001","size":"100,100"}
<h2>DEATH ENDING: Wrong Colors</h2>

You found colorful scrolls! Just... you know, all the *wrong* ones. And, because of it, you didn't live to see the outside of this section.


This ending is a 'death ending', which means it is one of many endings where the player is killed by an NPC because they took certain actions in a row, which they could avoided, but probably chose not to.
These endings are only found within the six genre sections.


There are six(6) total types of endings.



