:: What did you find, Officer Nat? {"position":"1898.3333333333335,2254.1666666666665","size":"100,100"}
"I saw the gun right away. It was put in a bag the moment one was available."


(link-goto: "Good to know.", (history:)'s last)


:: What did you find, partner? {"position":"1718.6666666666663,1935.5","size":"100,100"}
"We almost missed the hairs on her jacket, which was lying on the ground. It must have been pulled off her, but not before the killer left some DNA. We'll get it to the lab as soon as we wrap this up."


(link-goto: "Good to know.", (history:)'s last)


:: When did you arrive here, Officer James? {"position":"2031,2524.4999999999995","size":"100,100"}
"I was with the paramedics when they came in. Nat was already at the scene, keeping people back, except for those giving first responder assistance."


(link-goto: "Good to know.", (history:)'s last)


:: When did you arrive here, Officer Nat? {"position":"1888.3333333333335,2139.166666666667","size":"100,100"}
"I was the first on the scene. I secured the area for when others would arrive. By then, the paramedics had called time of death."


(link-goto: "Good to know.", (history:)'s last)


:: When did you arrive here, partner? {"position":"1568.6666666666663,1935.5","size":"100,100"}
"I was the last on the scene. The other officers were closer to the library than I was."


(link-goto: "Good to know.", (history:)'s last)


:: Who do you think did it, Officer James? {"position":"2156,2567.833333333333","size":"100,100"}
