:: favorite {"position":"1540.0000000000002,342.5000000000001","size":"100,100"}
"Oh," she says, chuckling, "It's hard to choose. I don't usually leave the main room, sadly. I stay here and make sure people have the assistance they need."

I nod, feeling like she changed the subject.

"Besides, I'm afraid I'd never find my way out," she sighs. "Libraries are curious places. And this one is hardly an exception."

I stare at the Librarian with confusion.

"Did you have another [[question|sections]]?"


