:: little girl {"position":"1745.6666666666665,317.50000000000006","size":"100,100"}
The little girl sees me coming. She’s sitting at a table pulled away from the table. Her legs swing in front of her.

Before I can get a word out, she says, “Mommy says I’m not supposed to talk to strangers.”


I ask her about her favorite [[section|Tantrum]].
I ask her what she's doing in the library [[alone|Tantrum]].
I offer her [[candy]].
I leave her [[alone|Chance for tips]].


