:: mirror {"position":"1091.6666666666667,244.16666666666669","size":"100,100"}
I walk over to the mirror.

It's a normal looking, very plain mirror that stretches across most of the wall.

But, when I turn my head a certain way, the mirror changes. It is still reflective, but it seems that beyond the glass, there are stars and galaxies swirling.

[["I don't think this is just a mirror..."|Restroom]]


