:: old man {"position":"1745.0000000000002,9.166666666666657","size":"100,100"}
The old man sitting in an armchair near an unlit fireplace snores as I step closer. I nudge his shoulder gently.

He doesn’t respond, only gripping his newspaper tighter.

“Sir?” I ask, nudging him more.

“What?” he snaps.


I ask him about his favorite [[section|Mystery Tip]].
I leave him [[alone|Chance for tips]].


