:: stalls {"position":"991.6666666666667,137.50000000000003","size":"100,100"}
I push open each stall, as they are all empty.
And none are normal.

One is mostly covered in moss.
Another has a few snakes chilling in the water.
The next could have been ordinary, if not for the colorful smoke coming out of the back of the toilet. Upon closer inspection, the bowl is completely dry, the same smoke filling it.
There is a toilet that looks to be made of solid gold.
And the final toilet has a puddle of blood on the floor in front of it.

[["I'll just hold it in."|Restroom]]


:: sunglasses {"position":"1286.666666666667,2155.833333333333","size":"100,100"}
A pair of sunglasses, too big to be Kate's, are in a evidence bag. They are broken in the middle, with glass missing from one of the eyeholes.

Signs of a struggle.


(link-goto: "Interesting...", (history:)'s last)


