:: woman {"position":"1743.9999999999995,214.16666666666669","size":"100,100"}
I walk over to a middle age woman flipping through a stack of books. “None of these books are educational,” she grumbles.

“Um, hi,” I say.

She looks up, “Are you a librarian?”

“…No,” I answer.

“Hm.” She goes back to her stack of books.


I ask her about her favorite [[section|Historical Tip]].
I leave her [[alone|Chance for tips]].


