:: young man {"position":"1743.3333333333335,112.50000000000001","size":"100,100"}
I walk over to the young man sitting at a table, pouring over a book open in front of him.

“Hello,” I greet. He doesn’t answer right away, so I repeat my greeting.

He looks up, then smiles as he sees me, “Hello.”


I ask him about his favorite [[section|Sci Fi Tip]].
I ask him what he's [[reading|Romance Tip]].
I leave him [[alone|Chance for tips]].
